      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "You hand the spec to the cluster with kubectl, which sends it to the API server."
        },
        {
          "text": "The API server checks that it's valid, then saves it in a datastore: etcd, or SQLite on a small k3s cluster."
        },
        {
          "text": "That saved spec is called the desired state."
        },
        {
          "text": "And saving it changes nothing: not a single copy is running yet."
        },
        {
          "text": "Something has to notice that gap, and act on it.",
          "pauseAfter": 0.4
        }
      ]
    },
