      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "That's the second half of the idea: controllers."
        },
        {
          "text": "A controller watches the desired state through the API server."
        },
        {
          "text": "It compares that with what's actually running."
        },
        {
          "text": "Then it acts to close the gap, for example by asking for a missing pod.",
          "senses": {
            "close": "verb"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "And then it does it again, and again, forever."
        },
        {
          "text": "The spec doesn't do anything; controllers make it true.",
          "pauseAfter": 0.8
        }
      ]
    },
