      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Put it all together, and every cluster has the same shape."
        },
        {
          "text": "The control plane is the brain: the API server, the datastore, the scheduler, and the controller manager."
        },
        {
          "text": "The worker nodes do the work: each runs a kubelet, a container runtime, and kube-proxy for Service networking."
        },
        {
          "text": "Everything talks through the API server, and only the API server talks to the datastore."
        },
        {
          "text": "On k3s, the whole control plane ships as one small binary, and that's what this series runs on.",
          "pauseAfter": 0.5
        }
      ]
    },
